---START---
explain (costs off)
select * from tbl where (c1,c2,c3) < (2,5,1);
                   QUERY PLAN                   
------------------------------------------------
 Bitmap Heap Scan on tbl
   Filter: (ROW(c1, c2, c3) < ROW(2, 5, 1))
   ->  Bitmap Index Scan on covering
         Index Cond: (ROW(c1, c2) <= ROW(2, 5))
(4 rows)

---END---
