---START---
explain (costs off)
select * from tbl where (c1,c2,c3) < (262,1,1) limit 1;
                     QUERY PLAN                     
----------------------------------------------------
 Limit
   ->  Index Only Scan using covering on tbl
         Index Cond: (ROW(c1, c2) <= ROW(262, 1))
         Filter: (ROW(c1, c2, c3) < ROW(262, 1, 1))
(4 rows)

